@advisor_longo
title: Luigi Longo
new-page: true

**Secretary of the PCI**

Longo's office focuses on party organisation, trade-union coordination and maintaining a workable balance between the leadership currents.

- @longo_union_network: Coordinate the trade-union network
- @longo_party_discipline: Consolidate the party organisation
- @advisor_hub: Return to advisors

@longo_union_network
title: Trade-union Network
new-page: true
