Q.public_support = Math.min(100,Q.public_support+2);
Q.advisor_longo_month = Q.month; Q.advisor_longo_year = Q.year;
!}
Longo coordinates the party's links with factory sections and union organisers. Trade-union backing and public support increase.

- @monthly_briefing: Return to campaign

