- @monthly_briefing: Return to government

@advance_month
title: Executive
subtitle: Advance the campaign by one month
card-image: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Governo_Fanfani_IV.jpg
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advance_month
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
/* Resolve the month that is ending before advancing the calendar. */
if (Q.year === 1969 && Q.month === 12) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 8);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 3);
}
if (Q.year === 1970 && Q.month === 7) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 5);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 2);
}
if (Q.year === 1974 && Q.month === 8) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 8);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 3);
}
if (Q.year === 1978 && Q.month === 3) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 10);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 5);
}
if (Q.year === 1978 && Q.month === 5) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 8);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 5);
}
if (Q.year === 1980 && Q.month === 8) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 10);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 5);
}
if (Q.year === 1981 && Q.month === 3) {
    Q.public_support = Math.max(0, Q.public_support - 5);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 8);
}
if (Q.year === 1982 && Q.month === 9) {
    Q.security = Math.max(0, Q.security - 8);
    Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 3);
}
/* Apply quarterly economic pressure on March, June, September and December. */
if (Q.month === 3 || Q.month === 6 || Q.month === 9 || Q.month === 12) {
    Q.inflation = Math.min(100, Q.inflation + 2);
    if (Q.inflation >= 85 || Q.security < 25) {
        Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 2);
    } else if (Q.public_support >= 60 && Q.security >= 40) {
        Q.stability = Math.min(100, Q.stability + 1);
    } else if (Q.inflation >= 75 || Q.security < 35) {
        Q.stability = Math.max(0, Q.stability - 1);
    }
}
Q.resources = Math.min(6, Q.resources + 1);
if (Q.month >= 12) {
    Q.month = 1;
    Q.year = Q.year + 1;
} else {
    Q.month = Q.month + 1;
}
!}
go-to: campaign_ending if year >= 1984

The month ends. Historical crises can damage public security, stability or confidence. Party resources recover slightly. Economic pressure rises at the end of each quarter, and political stability responds to economic strain, security and public confidence.

- @monthly_briefing: Begin next month

@campaign_ending
title: The End of the Years of Lead
new-page: true

**December 1983 — Campaign conclusion**

The Years of Lead did not end neatly, and Italy's political, social and institutional tensions continued beyond this point. Your decisions have shaped the condition of the Republic at the end of this campaign.

[? if stability >= 65 and public_support >= 55 and security >= 25 : **A resilient republic.** Institutions retain public confidence, and your political choices have helped preserve a path through the crisis. ?]
[? if stability < 35 or security < 25 : **A republic under severe strain.** Political instability and insecurity have undermined confidence in the state's ability to protect democratic life. ?]
[? if stability >= 35 and security >= 25 and public_support < 55 : **An unsettled compromise.** The Republic endures, but public confidence remains fragile and the future is uncertain. ?]
[? if stability >= 35 and security >= 25 and public_support >= 55 and stability < 65 : **A guarded recovery.** Public support has improved, but institutions remain vulnerable to renewed crises. ?]

**Final indicators**

Party: [+ party_name +]

Political position: [+ government_position +]

Public support: [+ public_support +] / 100

Political stability: [+ stability +] / 100

Public security: [+ security +] / 100

Economic pressure: [+ inflation +] / 100

